Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead, Saturday October\N31st is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,shaping up like a really nice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,one for Riverhead Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The sweet spot is 2:30 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to 5:00 PM, especially if\Nyou’re
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,eyeing a high-tide paddle\Nboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s sunny, around 52 degrees,\Nwith
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,wind 12 mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,High tides are 3:38 AM and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,3:53 PM, with lows at 9:35
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,AM and 10:22 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a heads up, wind may
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,reach 16 mph, so paddle with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,a little caution.
